  "details": "It's just scrolling through friends in the Friends Locations tab with all drop downs expanded. Instead of showing the friends name and status on the user button next to the world location card, it says literally \"Display ...\" and \"Status\". It's only a few of them and the rest show normal, and it seems that which user is affected is random. The user buttons affected are also transparent instead of the green rectangle, and the icons appear to be default.",
